B.ID=A.a(s(["Lantern Town keeps its lamps lit for travellers like you. UEC patrols rarely bother us here.","The job board posts woods and city errands \u2014 nests, caches, moonflowers. Come back to turn them in.","My stall trades glimmer for gear \u2014 plating, optics, charms. Ask to trade, or examine the stall beside me."]),t.s)
